# Routine "Weekly visibility brief": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every week, runs the whole prompt list, then reports which answers moved, who is winning, and the one thing to do about it.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/ai-search-visibility && pi -p "/weekly-visibility-brief"
